/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc11gd4.jpg"}], "slug": "gravitys-edge", "storyline": "Being of Afro-Caribbean roots, our protagonist adorns his father's jacket that is emboldened by their family crest (An adinkra symbol) to discover all that there is hidden in the stars. Get ready because on this journey to find your father, you'll comes across an array of characters at the outer edge of the worlds that will aid you. Ancient Statues, Shrine Monuments, Satellite Graveyards, Hidden Messages, A very very strange (but dedicated) group of outcasts. In this adventure your choices will matter as your decisions will lead you to 1 of 7 endings!", "summary": "Begin an epic space journey filled with strange worlds, engaging puzzles, and a dense Afro-punk theme. Another challenge also awaits you in 'Survival'. There you will face off against oncoming hordes while searching for the Ability Anvils. Are you ready to become a Kassler?", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/gravitys-edge", "videos": [{"id": 178216, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "n1JpFxrrf3Y", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n1JpFxrrf3Y", "title": "Gravity's Edge - Official Gameplay Trailer [ Indie-Credible Showcase 2026 ]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/n1JpFxrrf3Y/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}